42:38.940 --> 42:40.040
So, pretty safe

42:40.040 --> 42:40.320
looking.

42:40.600 --> 42:41.020
Right.

42:41.320 --> 42:42.280
So the macroscopic

42:42.280 --> 42:43.840
statistics had nothing

42:43.840 --> 42:44.700
interesting to say.

42:44.920 --> 42:45.700
It looked like a

42:45.700 --> 42:47.160
fairly safe, sparse

42:47.160 --> 42:47.560
network.

42:48.100 --> 42:49.480
But, when they ran

42:49.480 --> 42:50.080
the path-level

42:50.080 --> 42:50.980
witness search on the

42:50.980 --> 42:52.940
full graph, they

42:52.940 --> 42:53.440
found gold.

42:53.540 --> 42:53.780
Oh?

42:54.320 --> 42:56.260
Out of 525 external

42:56.260 --> 42:57.620
entry points in the

42:57.620 --> 42:58.580
distlib dependency,

42:58.580 --> 43:00.600
