43:05.540 --> 43:05.960
launcher.

43:06.560 --> 43:08.320
Six out of 525.

43:08.800 --> 43:09.960
That is incredibly

43:09.960 --> 43:10.860
precise targeting.

43:11.640 --> 43:12.720
But, we have to

43:12.720 --> 43:13.880
remember the massive

43:13.880 --> 43:14.820
caveat from earlier.

43:15.020 --> 43:15.840
The candidate path

43:15.840 --> 43:16.220
caveat.

43:16.780 --> 43:17.120
Yes.

43:17.680 --> 43:18.640
The paper digs into

43:18.640 --> 43:20.060
the nuanced, real-world

43:20.060 --> 43:21.160
reality of these six

43:21.160 --> 43:22.580
paths, and it's a

43:22.580 --> 43:23.640
perfect example of

43:23.640 --> 43:24.800
graph path versus

43:24.800 --> 43:25.980
executable path.

43:25.980 --> 43:28.060
For example, one of

43:28.060 --> 43:28.940
the paths went from

43:28.940 --> 43:29.800
an entry function

43:29.800 --> 43:31.300
