43:39.180 --> 43:39.560
line.

43:40.060 --> 43:40.740
But, when you look at

43:40.740 --> 43:41.440
the actual Python

43:41.440 --> 43:43.040
source code, you see

43:43.040 --> 43:43.920
the steel gate we

43:43.920 --> 43:44.680
talked about earlier.

43:45.240 --> 43:46.080
That call to

43:46.080 --> 43:47.480
signed file is

43:47.480 --> 43:48.460
buried inside an

43:48.460 --> 43:48.980
