44:02.960 --> 44:03.480
concept.

44:03.740 --> 44:04.740
A structural

44:04.740 --> 44:06.400
vulnerability exists,

44:06.760 --> 44:07.420
the code is wired

44:07.420 --> 44:08.780
together, but it

44:08.780 --> 44:09.760
