47:03.800 --> 47:04.420
You connect things that

47:04.420 --> 47:05.200
have nothing to do

47:05.200 --> 47:06.140
with each other, creating

47:06.140 --> 47:07.780
terrifying, but entirely

47:07.780 --> 47:09.080
fake vulnerability maps

47:09.080 --> 47:10.220
that waste everyone's

47:10.220 --> 47:10.440
time.

47:10.440 --> 47:11.740
It proves mathematically

47:11.740 --> 47:12.680
what many developers

47:12.680 --> 47:13.620
