47:18.880 --> 47:20.140
hold true within the

47:20.140 --> 47:21.500
specific abstraction you

47:21.500 --> 47:21.860
chose.

47:22.520 --> 47:23.400
If you use this strict

47:23.400 --> 47:24.840
graph and found zero

47:24.840 --> 47:26.200
paths, you aren't

47:26.200 --> 47:27.060
perfectly safe.

47:27.540 --> 47:28.420
You are only safe

47:28.420 --> 47:29.120
against statically

47:29.120 --> 47:30.220
resolvable attacks.

47:31.040 --> 47:32.300
The unresolved calls

47:32.300 --> 47:33.740
