47:33.740 --> 47:34.900
matter in your software

47:34.900 --> 47:35.400
universe.

47:35.840 --> 47:37.040
So as we bring this

47:37.040 --> 47:38.100
deep dive to a close,

47:38.200 --> 47:39.240
let's quickly recap the

47:39.240 --> 47:39.460
journey.

47:39.840 --> 47:40.920
We started by defining

47:40.920 --> 47:42.060
our maps, the

47:42.060 --> 47:43.220
microscopic full graph

47:43.220 --> 47:44.380
