48:50.980 --> 48:52.540
study, it raises a

48:52.540 --> 48:53.680
profound structural

48:53.680 --> 48:54.740
question for the future

48:54.740 --> 48:55.680
of software security.

48:56.320 --> 48:57.900
A massive, growing

48:57.900 --> 48:58.740
portion of modern

48:58.740 --> 49:00.160
software relies heavily on

49:00.160 --> 49:01.680
dynamic, runtime

49:01.680 --> 49:02.220
behavior.

49:02.500 --> 49:04.040
Code that decides what

49:04.040 --> 49:05.060
it's going to do, what

49:05.060 --> 49:06.560
types of handling, and

49:06.560 --> 49:07.840
what methods it's calling

49:07.840 --> 49:09.300
at the exact millisecond

49:09.300 --> 49:10.060
it executes.

49:10.740 --> 49:10.840
Yeah.

49:11.560 --> 49:13.120
As we saw, this behavior

49:13.120 --> 49:14.620
cannot be easily statically

49:14.620 --> 49:15.720
resolved without creating

49:15.720 --> 49:16.640
those massive name

49:16.640 --> 49:17.000
collisions.

49:17.580 --> 49:18.980
So, the question we have to

49:18.980 --> 49:20.040
ask ourselves is this.

49:20.860 --> 49:22.340
Are our current maps of

49:22.340 --> 49:23.960
the software supply chain

49:23.960 --> 49:25.080
fundamentally incomplete?

49:25.880 --> 49:27.420
Are we deploying all of our

49:27.420 --> 49:28.740
security resources trying to

49:28.740 --> 49:30.740
map a static landscape when

49:30.740 --> 49:32.100
in reality, the most

49:32.100 --> 49:33.140
dangerous roads only

49:33.140 --> 49:34.200
appear the moment the

49:34.200 --> 49:35.340
attacker starts driving on

49:35.340 --> 49:35.480
them?

49:36.080 --> 49:37.120
It's a heavy thought to

49:37.120 --> 49:38.080
mull over next time you

49:38.080 --> 49:39.980
type NPM install or PIP

49:39.980 --> 49:41.400
install and watch hundreds

49:41.400 --> 49:42.320
of unknown packages

49:42.320 --> 49:43.200
download into your

49:43.200 --> 49:43.640
project.

49:44.000 --> 49:45.060
Thank you for joining us on

49:45.060 --> 49:46.040
this deep dive into the

49:46.040 --> 49:47.140
hidden architecture of the

49:47.140 --> 49:48.920
software we rely on every

49:48.920 --> 49:49.420
single day.

49:49.920 --> 49:51.160
Keep questioning your maps.

